WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:07.051
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:07.052 --> 00:00:09.218
What do they see?

3
00:00:09.219 --> 00:00:12.983
They see an office.

4
00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:21.878
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:21.879 --> 00:00:40.845
They play with light switches.

6
00:00:40.846 --> 00:01:15.136
They play with chairs.

7
00:01:15.137 --> 00:01:35.978
They play with drawers.

8
00:01:35.979 --> 00:01:58.553
They play with markers.

9
00:01:58.554 --> 00:02:24.030
They play with a copy machine.

10
00:02:24.031 --> 00:02:40.623
They play with an elevator.

11
00:02:40.624 --> 00:02:49.287
Blobs, don't play with the elevator!

12
00:02:49.288 --> 00:03:00.109
The doors open and close.

13
00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.758
Silly blobs!

14
00:03:02.759 --> 00:03:05.456
Good-bye!

